      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "90000"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1018/90000"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0942f0b9405cc9911dbabfe",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "早安。\r\n今天的行程已经安排好了吗？\r\n别做多余的事，做好你的工作。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2895967e158189ef641e998872e3b72e70de75976c9e5e899d9542801f68cdc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "90001"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1018/90001"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:745e5d3d63e0eb875327e7a9",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "时间一刻一刻在流逝。\r\n快趁中午把能做完的事情处理完。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8c010a1173e199bf65c788b3fb64569c60cdb32aaf2d72c641843ca306cac52",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
